# Keys for "Tanya lalu lintas", the free traffic assistant. Copy this file to .env and fill in.
# .env is in .gitignore: keys never go to git, and the browser never sees them.
#
# FREE ONLY. Both services below are free; neither can charge you as long as you never add a credit
# card or upgrade the account. The app cannot call any other (paid) AI service.
#
# 1. Groq (main, very fast): https://console.groq.com  ->  API Keys  ->  Create API Key
#    Free plan. Do NOT add a card or upgrade to the paid "Developer" tier.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# 2. NVIDIA Build (backup when Groq is busy): https://build.nvidia.com  ->  Get API Key  (starts with nvapi-)
#    Free for prototyping, no card needed.
NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# Optional: pin a model. Leave empty to use the defaults in backend/assistant.py.
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# NVIDIA_MODEL=meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct
